{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 4, "ref": "jeremiah 40:4", "book": "jeremiah", "lang": "id", "chapter": 40, "translation": "Dan sekarang, lihat, aku membuka ikatanmu hari ini dari rantai yang di tanganmu. Jika baik di matamu untuk datang ⟨את⟩ bersamaku ke Bavel, datanglah, dan aku akan menetapkan ⟨את⟩ mataku atasmu; tetapi jika buruk di matamu untuk datang ⟨את⟩ bersamaku ke Bavel, tahanlah. Lihat, seluruh negeri ⟨itu⟩ di hadapanmu; ke mana pun yang baik dan yang lurus di matamu untuk pergi ke sana — pergilah.", "tokens": [{"surface": "ועתה", "gloss": "dan sekarang"}, {"surface": "הנה", "gloss": "lihat"}, {"surface": "פתחתיך", "gloss": "aku membuka ikatanmu"}, {"surface": "היום", "gloss": "hari ini"}, {"surface": "מן", "gloss": "dari"}, {"surface": "האזקים", "gloss": "rantai"}, {"surface": "אשר", "gloss": "yang"}, {"surface": "על", "gloss": "di"}, {"surface": "ידך", "gloss": "tanganmu"}, {"surface": "אם", "gloss": "jika"}, {"surface": "טוב", "gloss": "baik"}, {"surface": "בעיניך", "gloss": "di matamu"}, {"surface": "לבוא", "gloss": "untuk datang"}, {"surface": "אתי", "gloss": "⟨את⟩ bersamaku"}, {"surface": "בבל", "gloss": "Bavel"}, {"surface": "בא", "gloss": "datanglah"}, {"surface": "ואשים", "gloss": "dan aku akan menetapkan"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "mataku"}, {"surface": "עיני", "gloss": "mataku"}, {"surface": "עליך", "gloss": "atasmu"}, {"surface": "ואם", "gloss": "tetapi jika"}, {"surface": "רע", "gloss": "buruk"}, {"surface": "בעיניך", "gloss": "di matamu"}, {"surface": "לבוא", "gloss": "untuk datang"}, {"surface": "אתי", "gloss": "⟨את⟩ bersamaku"}, {"surface": "בבל", "gloss": "Bavel"}, {"surface": "חדל", "gloss": "tahanlah"}, {"surface": "ראה", "gloss": "lihat"}, {"surface": "כל", "gloss": "seluruh"}, {"surface": "הארץ", "gloss": "negeri"}, {"surface": "לפניך", "gloss": "di hadapanmu"}, {"surface": "אל", "gloss": "ke mana"}, {"surface": "טוב", "gloss": "baik"}, {"surface": "ואל", "gloss": "dan ke mana"}, {"surface": "הישר", "gloss": "yang lur